          "Id": 354,
          "SectionId": 134,
          "Type": 1,
          "TextContent": "\u003CFlowDocument FontSize=\u002214\u0022 Foreground=\u0022#FFFFFFFF\u0022 Background=\u0022#FF1A1A1A\u0022 TextAlignment=\u0022Center\u0022 FlowDirection=\u0022LeftToRight\u0022 ColumnWidth=\u0022Auto\u0022 IsOptimalParagraphEnabled=\u0022False\u0022 PageWidth=\u0022Auto\u0022 PageHeight=\u0022Auto\u0022 PagePadding=\u00225,0,5,0\u0022 IsHyphenationEnabled=\u0022False\u0022 AllowDrop=\u0022True\u0022 NumberSubstitution.CultureSource=\u0022User\u0022 xmlns=\u0022http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation\u0022\u003E\u003CParagraph Margin=\u00220,0,0,6\u0022 Padding=\u00220,0,0,0\u0022 TextAlignment=\u0022Left\u0022 FlowDirection=\u0022LeftToRight\u0022 LineHeight=\u0022Auto\u0022 Foreground=\u0022#FFFFFFFF\u0022\u003E\u003CRun BaselineAlignment=\u0022Baseline\u0022 FlowDirection=\u0022LeftToRight\u0022 Foreground=\u0022#FFFFFFFF\u0022 xml:space=\u0022preserve\u0022\u003EWhen a power interruption is detected by the RACe\u0027s UPS system a specific sequence of events must happen in order to power down correctly.  Once the power interruption is detected a script is run on the OP pc and SCALE pc, this script will send shutdown signals to the Service pc and Riv pc (if applicable). Once a set time has passed the UPS program will shutdown the OP pc and SCALE pc before removing 24v\u0027s to the rest of the machine.\u003C/Run\u003E\u003C/Paragraph\u003E\u003C/FlowDocument\u003E",
          "PlainTextContent": "When a power interruption is detected by the RACe\u0027s UPS system a specific sequence of events must happen in order to power down correctly.  Once the power interruption is detected a script is run on the OP pc and SCALE pc, this script will send shutdown signals to the Service pc and Riv pc (if applicable). Once a set time has passed the UPS program will shutdown the OP pc and SCALE pc before removing 24v\u0027s to the rest of the machine.",
